### 🟢 Regular Chat Memory Example
# Sends a user message to the regular chat memory controller
GET http://localhost:8080/memory?message=Hello AI
Accept: application/json

### 🟢 Test Different Queries
# Experiment with different prompts
GET http://localhost:8080/memory?message=Give me a quick tip on Spring AI
Accept: application/json

### 🟢 Another Example
# Try a follow-up message
GET http://localhost:8080/memory?message=Can you summarize our conversation so far?
Accept: application/json